From 9edf992a2718ae93d7ccc6b69b89f1a755084818 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 13:15:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add manual photo-assisted room builder

Adds builder.html: upload a photo or video frame, set a scale from two
clicked points, measure objects, then place furniture and exits on a
top-down plan. Saves into the existing plan so the route planner uses it.

Nothing is detected automatically. Photo sizes are estimates and are
marked as such. Exits snap to the nearest wall, and the layout cannot be
saved until it has at least one exit on a wall and no overlaps or
out-of-room items.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
